{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42564","headline":"句 · 刘昭禹","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"句向夜深得，心从天外归。\n危楼聊侧耳，高柳又鸣蝉。\n藓色围波井，花阴上竹楼。\n对面电瞋树，当街雨趁人。\n春光怀玉阙，万里起初程。\n江上呼风去，天边挂席飞。\n漆灯寻黑洞，之字上危峰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘昭禹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42564.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42564","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}